# Check text out with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF, and
# `gleam format --check` reports every source file as unformatted — a gate failure
# with nothing wrong in the repository. The blobs are already LF and CI on Linux
# passes, so the lie only appears on the machine a contributor actually works on.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.gleam text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf

# Never touched by end-of-line conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ez  binary
*.beam binary
